| `tools/ai-autonomy.php` | `pathMatches` enforces `kind: glob` with `fnmatch(..., FNM_PATHNAME)`; `plan --json` exposes `forbidden_rules`; D8 backstop reads the rule bucket without re-parsing / double-reporting | P2, P5 |
| `tools/ai-contract-lint.php` | Primary phantom = `forbidden_rules` (unbound bullets); fallback for rejected contracts hands each raw bullet to the **kernel parser** so both paths use one rule; added `--contract=PATH` for fixture self-tests | P3 |
